Third-party code notice

`vendor/vacuumtube-preload/` contains the page-side modules of VacuumTube 2.0.0,
extracted from the shipped `resources/app.asar` published by shy1132/VacuumTube
and reused here under the MIT licence above (the upstream licence text is kept
verbatim in `vendor/vacuumtube-preload/LICENSE`). `src/` of that directory is
unmodified; the three DIAL modules replaced by native code are documented in
`docs/FINDINGS.md`.

This project is an unofficial wrapper of YouTube Leanback and is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by YouTube or Google.
